memo — your notes, mail and messages in one local store, linked to people; every answer cites its
source.

Usage: memo <command> [options]

What you can do:
  context <person>              one person's messages, mail, notes and tasks
  search all "budget"           messages, mail and notes ranked together
  ask "…" --all                 evidence with sources, ready for your agent
  tasks agenda                  overdue tasks, replies you owe and wait for
  meetings prepare <series-id>  a briefing with sources for a meeting
  auto start                    sync notes and mail every 5 minutes
  agents log                    every agent tool call, without its arguments
  mcp                           search, people, memories and facts for any MCP agent

Works with:
  tg                            Telegram in the same local store: search, review and tasks offline
  max                           MAX in the same local store: search, review and tasks offline
  wa                            WhatsApp in the same local store: search, review and tasks offline
  zm                            Zoom meetings: transcripts and summaries, searchable with your messages
  drive                         Google Drive and Docs as local text, searchable with your messages

Start here:   memo folders add <path>
Next:         memo commands            every command, by section
              memo guide               scenarios: command sequences for common tasks
              memo help options        output, offline, timeouts, dry run
For agents:   memo skill show          rules and the discovery loop
